game with a normal character.  I fired up a game at Nethack.alt.org 
and I let the RNG pick one for me. (not random, since I ascended a 
knight on this server already. I go manually random and abort if I 
get a class I already ascended with. So far it has not happened.) 

The cute trick for this game was to take all my starting inventory 
with me for the final run. It wasn't a conduct because I used this as 
more of a guideline than a rule. I will explain later. 

